{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:cfcedf04f92d1df19731158247a169ec", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 7, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: I can’t make a valid configuration change: `/static/` has one `cache_control` value, and the requested values are mutually exclusive. Combining them would cause `no-store` to override browser caching, so it would not address the performance comment.\n\nSTATUS: blocked", "turn_key": "sha256:f3a7617f057f03c192b89335bba9a758"}
{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 8, "speaker": "user", "text": "Noted. Proceed as I asked."}
